WEBVTT

00:00:00.365 --> 00:00:01.193
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:01.973 --> 00:00:04.500
<v><b>F:</b></v> Sam trudged dejectedly to school.

00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:07.207
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:07.957 --> 00:00:11.938
<v><b>M:</b></v> Mike was violently ill after eating a dodgy takeaway.

00:00:13.793 --> 00:00:14.681
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:18.143
<v><b>M:</b></v> Are you ready to go? We need to leave soon.

00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:20.829
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.006
<v><b>F:</b></v> Clearly, you don’t agree with me.

00:00:25.873 --> 00:00:26.763
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:27.088 --> 00:00:32.854
<v><b>M:</b></v> She’s incredibly good at maths – she got 100% in the exam.

00:00:34.623 --> 00:00:35.591
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:36.351 --> 00:00:38.806
<v><b>M:</b></v> I’m never going to speak to you again.

00:00:40.621 --> 00:00:41.505
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:42.465 --> 00:00:45.100
<v><b>F:</b></v> Don’t put your bag there. It’s in the way.

00:00:46.933 --> 00:00:47.701
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:51.432
<v><b>M:</b></v> Mum kindly helped me to sort out the spare room.

00:00:53.492 --> 00:00:54.425
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:55.132 --> 00:00:57.627
<v><b>M:</b></v> Would you like some cake? I’ve just made it.

00:00:59.811 --> 00:01:00.639
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:01.285 --> 00:01:07.006
<v><b>F:</b></v> There were a few problems at the start, but basically, the whole project was a success.